# Git workflow

- At the end of each completed task, commit its changes locally.
- Do not push unless the user explicitly requests a push for that task. Earlier push requests do not authorize future pushes.
- Include only changes belonging to the task. If its changes are already committed, report the existing commit instead of creating an empty commit.
